The AOSP components below are compiled by aosp/ (cargo xtask aosp-build)
at tag android-17.0.0_r1 (commits in aosp/aosp.lock), from
https://android.googlesource.com. Nothing built from them ships yet; the
full license texts are added here when they do. Each license file named is
in the fetched project (third_party/aosp/<path>).

- ART (libartbase, libdexfile, libartpalette, runtime headers)
  platform/art - Apache-2.0 - NOTICE
- bionic headers (libc/include, libc/platform, libc/kernel)
  platform/bionic - Apache-2.0, BSD, ISC, MIT (libc/NOTICE); the kernel
  UAPI headers are generated and contain only constants, structures and
  macros
- liblog - platform/system/logging - Apache-2.0 - liblog/NOTICE
- libbase - platform/system/libbase - Apache-2.0 and BSD - NOTICE
- libcutils, libutils (parts) - platform/system/core - Apache-2.0 -
  libutils/NOTICE, file headers
- libziparchive - platform/system/libziparchive - Apache-2.0 - file headers
- libnativehelper headers - platform/libnativehelper - Apache-2.0 - NOTICE
- modules-utils build headers - platform/frameworks/libs/modules-utils -
  Apache-2.0 - file headers
- fmtlib - platform/external/fmtlib - MIT - LICENSE
- zlib (Chromium zlib) - platform/external/zlib - Zlib - LICENSE
- lz4, lib/ only - platform/external/lz4 - BSD-2-Clause - lib/LICENSE
- tinyxml2 - platform/external/tinyxml2 - Zlib - LICENSE.txt
- dlmalloc header (read by the libart attempt) - platform/external/dlmalloc
  - public domain (explicit dedication) - NOTICE
- VIXL (AArch64 assembler for ART's arm64 code generator, spike S1) -
  platform/external/vixl - BSD-3-Clause - LICENCE
- LZMA SDK, including its SHA-1 (dex2oat's oat build IDs, spike S1) -
  platform/external/lzma - public domain (explicit dedication) - NOTICE,
  file headers

